SUMMARY:Annual Global ISAM Congress 2027
DESCRIPTION:The International Society of Addiction Medicine plans its nex
 t annual global congress in Seattle\, United States\, from August 26 to 
 28\, 2027. Related events listed on the same schedule include an Innovat
 ion Day and a Women and Addiction Day on August 25\, 2027\, and a board 
 meeting on August 24\, 2027.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission: 2027-02-
 26 (estimated)\n\nhttps://isamweb.org/annual/
LOCATION:Seattle\, Washington
URL:https://isamweb.org/annual/
